# Day 17 - HTML Basics and Colors

## 📚 Learning Objectives

* Learned what HTML is.
* Learned the difference between tags and elements.
* Learned how to add colors using CSS.

## HTML Concepts

### Tag

Example:

```html
<h1>
```

Tags tell the browser what something is.

### Element

Example:

```html
<h1>Gowdham</h1>
```

An element consists of:

* Opening tag
* Content
* Closing tag

## New CSS Properties

### Background Color

```css
background-color: lightgray;
```

Changes the page background color.

### Text Color

```css
color: black;
```

Changes the text color.

### Font Family

```css
font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
```

Changes the font style.

